Expected elements: present

All five changes landed on this view. The `Age` row states "No timestamp published" rather than deriving one; a `Type` row reads `public`; the full hash sits in a bordered white box with a "click to select" caption. The provenance note is flush-left in a full-width white `dd` at a ~95-character measure. `COST · MANA` reads `42000 / 100000 mana (FeeJuice)` in base ten. The decoded-input note is the no-selector-and-no-calldata sentence, correctly with no "supply an ABI" action, which here could not succeed. The breadcrumb reads `Home / demo / tx`. The provenance marker is form (c), the `Data` row, correctly alone. No P1. Value/nonce rows are absent because this chain has neither; inventing them would be the honesty failure.

Contrast is clean: every text-on-surface pair I sampled is ≥5.4:1 (placeholder #565656 on #DDDDDD = 5.40; grid labels #484848 on #DDDDDD = 6.73; footer marks and heart all drawn in #4F46E5 at 6.29). This light theme is designed, not inverted.

The failures are colour-role discipline. One neutral chip carries three meanings in three consecutive grid rows. The hero puts indigo #4F46E5 14px from blue #2563EB. The raw block is the only panel with no fill.

Highest-priority fixes: give `Canonical: Yes` the affirmative tone and `Finality: Pending` a distinct one; retune the info blue away from the brand indigo, or fill the `On demand` pill.

Rating: 7/10

